{"seq":2,"slug":"cnc-machining-fundamentals","title":"数控加工基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/smart-manufacturing-practice/cnc-machining-fundamentals","wordCount":2059,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"数控加工基础\">数控加工基础</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>数控（CNC）加工通过预先编写的程序控制机床自动完成切削运动，是现代机械加工的基本方式。相比手动操作，数控加工在精度一致性、加工效率和复杂形状实现能力上具有明显优势。中职机电专业学生需要理解坐标系建立原理、掌握常用指令代码、具备简单零件的编程能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数控机床坐标系\">数控机床坐标系</h3><p>数控加工中存在三套相互关联的坐标系，理解它们的关系是正确编程的前提：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[&quot;数控机床坐标系体系&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;机床坐标系&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;工件坐标系&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;编程坐标系&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;固定不变,机床出厂标定&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;随工件装夹位置确定&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;编程时自定义,与工件坐标系重合&quot;]\">graph TB\n    A[\"数控机床坐标系体系\"] --&gt; B[\"机床坐标系\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"工件坐标系\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"编程坐标系\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"固定不变,机床出厂标定\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"随工件装夹位置确定\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"编程时自定义,与工件坐标系重合\"]</pre><p><strong>机床坐标系（Machine Coordinate System）</strong></p>\n<p>由机床制造商在出厂时标定，原点称为&quot;机床零点&quot;或&quot;机床原点&quot;。各轴方向遵循右手定则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Z 轴：与主轴轴线重合，刀具远离工件方向为正</li>\n<li>X 轴：水平面内垂直于 Z 轴，车床上为径向（远离主轴中心为正）</li>\n<li>Y 轴：由右手定则确定</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每次开机需执行&quot;回参考点&quot;操作，使机床建立绝对位置基准。</p>\n<p><strong>工件坐标系（Workpiece Coordinate System）</strong></p>\n<p>由操作者根据工件的加工特征设定。设定方法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>试切法：刀具接触工件端面/外圆，记录当前机床坐标作为偏置值</li>\n<li>对刀仪法：使用机内对刀仪自动测量刀尖坐标</li>\n<li>寻边器法：用寻边器确定工件边缘位置</li>\n</ol>\n<p>工件坐标系原点（W 点）的选取原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>尽量与设计基准重合</li>\n<li>车削加工：通常设在工件右端面中心</li>\n<li>铣削加工：通常设在工件左下角（顶面或底面）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>编程坐标系</strong></p>\n<p>程序员编程时使用的坐标系，通过 G54-G59 指令将编程坐标系与工件坐标系关联。数控系统最多支持 6 个工件坐标系偏置（G54 为默认）。</p>\n<p>三者关系：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>机床</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>工件</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>偏置值</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{机床}} = P_{\\text{工件}} + \\text{偏置值}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">机床</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">工件</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">偏置值</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3 id=\"g-代码与-m-代码\">G 代码与 M 代码</h3><p>G 代码（准备功能）控制机床的运动方式，M 代码（辅助功能）控制机床的开关动作。</p>\n<p><strong>核心 G 代码</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代码</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>G00</td>\n<td>快速定位</td>\n<td>G00 X_ Z_</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G01</td>\n<td>直线插补</td>\n<td>G01 X_ Z_ F_</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G02</td>\n<td>顺时针圆弧插补</td>\n<td>G02 X_ Z_ R_（或 I_ K_）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G03</td>\n<td>逆时针圆弧插补</td>\n<td>G03 X_ Z_ R_（或 I_ K_）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G41</td>\n<td>刀具半径左补偿</td>\n<td>G41 D_</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G42</td>\n<td>刀具半径右补偿</td>\n<td>G42 D_</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G40</td>\n<td>取消刀具补偿</td>\n<td>G40</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>G00 快速定位</strong>：各轴以最大速度独立运动到目标点，轨迹不可预测（非直线），仅用于空行程。</p>\n<p><strong>G01 直线插补</strong>：刀具沿直线从当前点运动到目标点，进给速度 F 单位为 mm/min（铣削）或 mm/r（车削）。</p>\n<p>切削速度与进给量的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_f = f \\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为进给速度（mm/min），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 为每转进给量（mm/r），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为主轴转速（r/min）。</p>\n<p><strong>G02/G03 圆弧插补</strong>：</p>\n<p>两种编程方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>R 方式：<code>G02 X_ Z_ R_</code>（R 为圆弧半径，优弧为负值）</li>\n<li>I/K 方式：<code>G02 X_ Z_ I_ K_</code>（I、K 为圆心相对于起点的增量坐标）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当圆弧大于半圆时必须用 I/K 方式或将 R 取负值。</p>\n<p><strong>G41/G42 刀具半径补偿</strong>：</p>\n<p>实际刀具有刀尖圆弧半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，若不补偿会产生过切或欠切。补偿方向判定：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;沿刀具进给方向看&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;工件在左侧 → G41&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;工件在右侧 → G42&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"沿刀具进给方向看\"] --&gt; B[\"工件在左侧 → G41\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"工件在右侧 → G42\"]</pre><p><strong>核心 M 代码</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代码</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>M03</td>\n<td>主轴正转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M04</td>\n<td>主轴反转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M05</td>\n<td>主轴停止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M08</td>\n<td>切削液开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M09</td>\n<td>切削液关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M30</td>\n<td>程序结束并返回开头</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"简单零件加工编程\">简单零件加工编程</h3><p><strong>轴类零件（车削）加工路线设计</strong></p>\n<p>加工一个阶梯轴（大径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi 40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span>、小径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span>、总长 80mm）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"O0001;                    (程序号)&#10;G99 G97 S800 M03;        (每转进给，转速800r/min，主轴正转)&#10;T0101;                    (1号外圆刀，1号刀补)&#10;G00 X42. Z2.;            (快速定位到工件外)&#10;G01 Z0 F0.1;             (进给到端面)&#10;G01 X-0.5 F0.05;         (车端面，过中心)&#10;G00 X42. Z2.;            (退刀)&#10;G01 X30. F0.1;           (切入到φ30)&#10;G01 Z-40. F0.15;         (车削小径段，长40mm)&#10;G01 X40.;                (车台阶面)&#10;G01 Z-80. F0.15;         (车削大径段)&#10;G01 X42.;                (退出)&#10;G00 X100. Z50.;          (退到安全位置)&#10;M30;                     (程序结束)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>O0001;                    (程序号)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>G99 G97 S800 M03;        (每转进给，转速800r/min，主轴正转)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>T0101;                    (1号外圆刀，1号刀补)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>G00 X42. Z2.;            (快速定位到工件外)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>G01 Z0 F0.1;             (进给到端面)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>G01 X-0.5 F0.05;         (车端面，过中心)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>G00 X42. Z2.;            (退刀)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>G01 X30. F0.1;           (切入到φ30)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>G01 Z-40. F0.15;         (车削小径段，长40mm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>G01 X40.;                (车台阶面)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>G01 Z-80. F0.15;         (车削大径段)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>G01 X42.;                (退出)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>G00 X100. Z50.;          (退到安全位置)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>M30;                     (程序结束)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>盘类零件（铣削）加工路线设计原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>先面后孔：先铣平面建立定位基准，再加工孔系</li>\n<li>先粗后精：粗加工去除余量，精加工保证尺寸</li>\n<li>先主后次：先加工主要表面（配合面），后加工次要表面</li>\n<li>基准先行：作为后续加工基准的表面优先加工</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"刀具选择与装夹\">刀具选择与装夹</h3><p><strong>车削常用刀具</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>刀具类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>主偏角</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>93° 外圆刀</td>\n<td>外圆、端面、倒角</td>\n<td>93°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切槽刀</td>\n<td>切槽、切断</td>\n<td>90°（径向）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>螺纹刀</td>\n<td>车削外螺纹/内螺纹</td>\n<td>60°（牙型角）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内孔刀</td>\n<td>镗孔</td>\n<td>依孔径选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>刀具材料选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>高速钢（HSS）：韧性好，用于低速精加工和丝锥、钻头</li>\n<li>硬质合金：硬度高、耐磨，主流车削/铣削刀片材料</li>\n<li>陶瓷刀具：适用于高速精车淬硬钢（切削速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>500</mn><mtext>m/min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_c = 200\\text{-}500\\text{m/min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m/min</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>工件装夹方式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>装夹方式</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>三爪卡盘</td>\n<td>自动定心，装夹快</td>\n<td>圆形/正六边形截面，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L/D &lt; 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四爪卡盘</td>\n<td>可夹非圆截面，需找正</td>\n<td>异形件、偏心加工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顶尖+拨盘</td>\n<td>刚性好，长轴不易变形</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L/D &gt; 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 的轴类件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一夹一顶</td>\n<td>卡盘夹持+尾座顶尖支撑</td>\n<td>中长轴类件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>装夹注意事项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>三爪卡盘夹持长度不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，夹持力与切削力匹配</li>\n<li>细长轴（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L/D &gt; 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>）需使用中心架或跟刀架</li>\n<li>工件伸出卡盘部分过长时必须加顶尖支撑</li>\n<li>薄壁件夹紧力过大会导致变形，需使用软爪或专用夹具</li>\n</ul>\n<p>切削用量三要素计算参考：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_c = \\frac{\\pi D n}{1000}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为切削速度（m/min），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为工件直径（mm），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为主轴转速（r/min）。</p>\n<p>已知推荐切削速度反算转速：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1000</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = \\frac{1000 v_c}{\\pi D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例：加工 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi 40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 铝件，推荐 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mtext>m/min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_c = 300\\text{m/min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m/min</span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3.14</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>2389</mn><mtext>r/min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = \\frac{1000 \\times 300}{3.14 \\times 40} \\approx 2389\\text{r/min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3.14</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">40</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1000</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">300</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2389</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">r/min</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026 年数控加工领域的显著变化是 AI 辅助编程和自适应加工的推广。CAM 软件中集成的 AI 路径优化功能可根据毛坯形状自动生成最优切削策略，减少空行程和刀具载荷波动。机床内置的振动传感器配合自适应控制算法，能在加工中实时调整进给速度——遇到硬点自动减速、余量小时自动提速。五轴联动加工中心的价格持续下降，使复杂曲面零件的一次装夹完成成为可能。数字化刀具管理系统通过 RFID 芯片追踪每把刀的切削时长和磨损状态，自动提示换刀时机。这些趋势使操作者的角色从&quot;按按钮的人&quot;转向&quot;工艺决策者&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一根棒料需要车削成三段阶梯轴：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi 50 \\times 30\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>35</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>40</mn><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi 35 \\times 40\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">35</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>25</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi 25 \\times 30\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>。以右端面中心为工件原点，写出完整的粗车程序（每刀切深 2mm，进给 0.2mm/r）。</li>\n<li>某零件轮廓包含一段 R15 的圆弧（起点 X30 Z-20，终点 X0 Z-35，顺时针方向），分别用 R 方式和 I/K 方式写出这段圆弧的 G 代码指令。</li>\n<li>加工 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 的 45# 钢外圆（推荐切削速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mtext>m/min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_c = 120\\text{m/min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m/min</span></span></span></span></span></span>，每转进给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mtext>mm/r</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = 0.25\\text{mm/r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm/r</span></span></span></span></span></span>），计算主轴转速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 和进给速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>分析以下情况应选用 G41 还是 G42：刀具沿工件外轮廓逆时针方向走刀加工外圆。画出刀具路径与工件轮廓的位置关系示意。</li>\n<li>实训任务：在数控车床上完成一个带 R3 圆弧过渡的阶梯轴加工。要求：编写程序、模拟验证、实际切削、测量尺寸（外径精度 ±0.05mm）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数控加工的核心是将零件几何信息转化为机床能执行的程序指令。坐标系体系建立了编程的空间参考框架；G 代码与 M 代码构成了指令系统的&quot;语言&quot;；加工路线设计体现了工艺思维——先面后孔、先粗后精；刀具选择和装夹方案直接影响加工精度和效率。中职阶段重点掌握直线、圆弧插补和简单轴类/盘类零件编程，为后续学习宏程序、多轴加工和 CAM 自动编程奠定基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数控加工基础","id":"数控加工基础"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"数控机床坐标系","id":"数控机床坐标系"},{"level":3,"text":"G 代码与 M 代码","id":"g-代码与-m-代码"},{"level":3,"text":"简单零件加工编程","id":"简单零件加工编程"},{"level":3,"text":"刀具选择与装夹","id":"刀具选择与装夹"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工业机器人基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/smart-manufacturing-practice/industrial-robot-basics"},"next":{"title":"数字化制造趋势","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/smart-manufacturing-practice/digital-manufacturing-trends"}}